      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WAMBOYNEINAMERICA (10) won at Menangle two runs ago before a good effort for fifth to the flying Captains Knock at his latest appearance. Draws on the back row but drops in grade and is suited returning to a circuit and distance where he has won five of eight attempts. I BREAK THE LINE (8) went back from a second line draw when resuming last start before working home to finish 2.8 metres from a smart winner in second at Bathurst. May need a bit of luck negotiating a very wide starting position but he is a two-time second-up winner so should be improved and owns a strong record at this circuit and distance. DANCE WITH CARMER (7) has yet to miss a place when second-up so can improve off last Saturday's fourth when resuming at Menangle. JAY OK (9) draws for a trail and could be close to a win after some nice efforts at Menangle including a second last Saturday.",
